 * It used to be a cn / everything-else split, so the German, French,
 * Japanese and Korean pages all shipped the English title and the
 * English body copy - five pages with the same <title> competing for
 * the same queries, and a German page asking a German buyer to read
 * English. The six language versions now each carry their own title,
 * description and body copy.
 *
 * The copy deliberately makes no claim that has not been verified
 * (see docs/seo-specialty-pages-audit-2026-08-25.md): it is a
 * specification-request page, not a catalogue page.
 */
